@startuml
' Order state diagram simplified draft v0.2, 2026-11-03.
' Reference: https://plantuml.com/zh/state-diagram
!pragma layout smetana
title 校园二手交易系统订单主流程状态图 初稿
hide empty description
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F5F5F5
skinparam stateBorderColor #777777
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
skinparam nodesep 30
skinparam ranksep 30

state "交易进行中" as Active {
  state "待确认" as Pending
  state "待付款" as WaitingPayment
  state "待交付" as Ready
  state "交付中" as Delivering

  Pending -down-> WaitingPayment : 线上售卖\n确认方案
  WaitingPayment -down-> Ready : 付款成功
  Pending --> Ready : 线下或赠送\n确认方案
  Ready -down-> Delivering : 代交人取件
}

state "已完成" as Completed
state "已取消" as Cancelled
state CompletedEnd <<end>>
state CancelledEnd <<end>>

[*] --> Pending : 预约成功
Ready --> Completed : 见面交付\n[完成条件满足]
Delivering --> Completed : 交件并确认收货
Active -right-> Cancelled : 符合取消规则
Ready -[hidden]right-> Cancelled
Completed --> CompletedEnd
Cancelled --> CancelledEnd

legend bottom
  确认方案：卖家接受，且双方确认同一方案。
  完成：付费已付款且已收货；赠送已收货；代交还须交件。
  取消：卖家拒绝、24小时未接受、线上30分钟未付；
  普通未付售卖须双方同意，赠送取件前可取消；
  已付款或已取件后的异常须管理员核实，已取件先核实退回。
  取消不等于退款；售后另建记录，已完成订单不回退。
endlegend
@enduml
